------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=200 nis weird woman respond to elemental
Text=I have not heard that name in many ages, not since we clashed so long ago as bitter enemies. Stranger, you should know that the spirit within you is wise and good, but ignorant of my transformation and rigidly incapable of forgiving my past sins.
